  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Key-idea</p><p>Use Nernst equation, i.e.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mfenced><mi>emf</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><msub><mo>&#176;</mo><mi>cell</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0591</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>Zn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>For reaction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><msub><mo>&#176;</mo><mfenced><mi>cell</mi></mfenced></msub><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0591</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><msub><mo>&#176;</mo><mfenced><mi>cell</mi></mfenced></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0591</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>For reaction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><msub><mo>&#176;</mo><mfenced><mi>cell</mi></mfenced></msub><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0591</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><msub><mo>&#176;</mo><mfenced><mi>cell</mi></mfenced></msub></math></p><p>For reaction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><msub><mo>&#176;</mo><mfenced><mi>cell</mi></mfenced></msub><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0591</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><msub><mo>&#176;</mo><mfenced><mi>cell</mi></mfenced></msub><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0591</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>.</p>",
